flowchart TB
  accTitle: Bank sync and reconciliation
  accDescr: Actual Budget reads two linked accounts through Enable Banking. I compare budget snapshots to check matched and new entries, then reconcile the booked balance separately from pending amounts.
  start["Start bank sync in Actual"] --> feed["Read two linked accounts<br/>via Enable Banking"]
  feed --> audit["Compare budget snapshots<br/>before and after sync"]
  audit --> existing["Check existing records<br/>against bank references"]
  audit --> added["Count new entries<br/>and check for duplicates"]
  existing --> balance["Reconcile booked balance<br/>against the bank"]
  added --> balance
  balance --> pending["Account separately<br/>for pending transactions"]
